  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Programme to Public Finance Management &amp; the Stepping Stone Economic Partnership Agreement (EPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed programme is, in the context of the Ghana beyond aid vision, to strengthen public sector financial management and accountability for both revenue and expenditure for sustained economic growth and to maximise the benefits of the EPA for Ghana.</narrative>
  </description>
